== Palette de couleurs

Les couleurs INSA sont accessibles via le dictionnaire `insa-colors` :

- #box(width: .8em, height: .8em, fill: insa-colors.primary, radius: 2pt)[] `insa-colors.primary` — Rouge INSA (\#e42618)
- #box(width: .8em, height: .8em, fill: insa-colors.secondary, radius: 2pt)[] `insa-colors.secondary` — Or INSA (\#f69f1d)
- #box(width: .8em, height: .8em, fill: insa-colors.tertiary, stroke: .5pt + gray, radius: 2pt)[] `insa-colors.tertiary` — Rose clair (\#f5adaa)

Ces couleurs peuvent etre utilisees n'importe ou dans la presentation :

#align(center)[
  #box(fill: insa-colors.primary, radius: 4pt, inset: 12pt)[
    #text(fill: white, weight: "bold")[Alerte rouge]
  ]
  #h(1em)
  #box(fill: insa-colors.secondary, radius: 4pt, inset: 12pt)[
    #text(fill: black, weight: "bold")[Information]
  ]
  #h(1em)
  #box(fill: insa-colors.tertiary, radius: 4pt, inset: 12pt)[
    #text(weight: "bold")[Note douce]
  ]
]

